invariant: INV-14
file: webpki_ticket.c
catches: webpki_session_test
reason: an init call skips the hash when the session presents a ticket, even
  when it takes tickets. So a resumed session binds the tickets it
  receives to an all-zero hash, and none of them resumes. The row that
  presents a ticket and sets on_ticket counts no hash where it requires
  one.

--- old
    return cfg->on_ticket != NULL;
--- new
    return cfg->on_ticket != NULL && cfg->ticket == NULL;
